@* A brand's line with a link under it as its subtext (FX168): the line, then the link, its mark before its words,
   opening in a tab of its own. The mark is decoration beside the words, which say where it goes. *@
<span class="brand-note"><span class="brand-note-line">@Line</span><a class="brand-note-link" href="@Href" target="_blank" rel="noopener">@Mark @LinkText</a></span>
